<urn:atm:triage:finding/AW3-QA-B1>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AW3-QA-B1" ;
  triage:title "atm log --source merged is not implemented: Timeline and Merged both route through run_timeline (SQLite only), no JSONL/graft-fallback read, no (source_rank, seq) tiebreak, source hardcoded to timeline" ;
  triage:description "qa-pr1182-r1 (msg 01M1QSQWFKBENPSW4ZP83SKMYS) at 199a3bfeb: req-qa ATM-QA-101 and ruthless-boundary-qa RBQA-F001 (critical) independently confirmed LogSource::Timeline and LogSource::Merged both call run_timeline(), which only queries the SQLite timeline. JSONL and the graft-fallback satellite are never read, there is no ascending-ts sort with the documented (source_rank, seq) tiebreak (jsonl=0 graft=1 timeline=2), and TimelineRecord::from_event hardcodes source='timeline' even in merged mode, mislabeling provenance. Fails AC3 and the core D2-CLI deliverable of sprint-AW.3." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-aw" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "cli-log-query" ;
  triage:severity "blocking" ;
